WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:04.136 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:05.438
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.439
According to ex-White House
Press Secretary

00:00:07.439 --> 00:00:10.776
Stephanie Grisham's new book,
former President Trump

00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:13.412
was once asked to go vegan for
charity.

00:00:13.412 --> 00:00:15.615
But if you didn't
lose him at "vegan,"

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:18.417
I'm sure you lost him
at "charity."

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:21.054
In the same book, former Trump
administration's staffer

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:23.389
Stephanie Grisham describes the
White House as,

00:00:23.389 --> 00:00:27.159
"A clown car on fire, running at
full speed into a warehouse

00:00:27.159 --> 00:00:28.494
full of fireworks."

00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:30.429
But she apparently doesn't
mention the part

00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:33.399
where she called shotgun.

00:00:33.399 --> 00:00:35.501
Former President Trump,
last week, called into

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:39.339
a prophecy-focused conservative
Christian talk show

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:42.275
and said "nobody has done more
for Christianity

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:46.712
or free evangelicals, or for
religion itself than I have."

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:50.216
Really? Nobody? You can't think
of a single person?

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.584
Jesus Christ.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.953
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:56.388
Former President Trump
reportedly tells people

00:00:56.388 --> 00:00:59.926
constantly that he's running for
President in 2024.

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:04.897
Well, he doesn't tell everyone,
it's your year, Mike.

00:01:04.897 --> 00:01:06.666
After postponing
last week's vote

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:09.168
on the bipartisan infrastructure
package,

00:01:09.168 --> 00:01:12.071
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi on
Saturday set a new

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:14.373
Halloween deadline because
nothing is spookier

00:01:14.373 --> 00:01:18.444
to Democrats than actually
passing legislation.

00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:21.647
According to a recent survey 10%
of Americans said that they feel

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:25.418
very pessimistic about the rest
of 2021

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:29.088
while the other 90% said,
"It's 2021?"

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:32.091
Clint Eastwood, on Friday, won a
$6 million lawsuit

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:35.194
against a Lithuanian company
that used his image

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:36.830
to promote CBD products.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:38.798
I'm not sure how they used his
image,

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:41.501
but I'm guessing as "Before"?

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:44.436
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.436 --> 00:01:47.774
Passengers on a Spirit Airline's
plane in Atlantic City,

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:50.276
New Jersey were forced to
deplane over the weekend

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:53.246
after a large bird
caused an engine fire.

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:57.183
And this is sad, that bird still
had a better time

00:01:57.183 --> 00:02:01.286
than everyone who spent the
weekend in Atlantic City.

00:02:01.286 --> 00:02:03.923
According to a new book, former
First Lady Melania Trump

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:06.726
obsessively read her own press
coverage because you can only

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:09.395
re-read your marriage contract
so many times.

00:02:10.029 --> 00:02:11.631
And finally,
according to a new survey,

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:15.601
42% of Americans said that they
feel bad if they don't

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:16.969
do anything productive all day.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:19.906
Fortunately, clicking this
counts as productive.

00:02:21.507 --> 00:02:25.277
Facebook went offline yesterday
for over 6 hours.

00:02:25.277 --> 00:02:27.380
Wow, they finally found
something

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.249
they couldn't fix
with horse past.

00:02:30.249 --> 00:02:32.351
Facebook apologized yesterday
after all three

00:02:32.351 --> 00:02:35.588
of its social media platforms
went offline for 6 hours.

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:39.992
And said it was due to a "faulty
configuration change."

00:02:39.992 --> 00:02:43.696
Adding, "after a quick reboot,
he started working again."

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:46.632
President Biden said yesterday
that he couldn't guarantee

00:02:46.632 --> 00:02:49.668
that the Federal Government will
not default on debt payments

00:02:49.668 --> 00:02:52.905
due later this month, so in
addition to everything else

00:02:52.905 --> 00:02:56.309
going on we've now entered
the "uncut gems" phase

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:57.810
of his presidency.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:00.013
Right now he's on the phone at
the Bellagio saying,

00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:02.681
"Put all of Montana on red."

00:03:02.681 --> 00:03:04.283
During a Zoom session yesterday

00:03:04.283 --> 00:03:05.984
with the House Progressive
Caucus,

00:03:05.984 --> 00:03:08.821
President Biden reportedly said
that he's frustrated

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:11.323
with Senators Joe Manchin
and Kyrsten Sinema.

00:03:11.323 --> 00:03:14.794
Well, you know it's bad when a
78-year-old man is on Zoom

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:17.997
and that's not
the frustrating part.

00:03:17.997 --> 00:03:20.399
During a briefing yesterday,
White House Press Secretary

00:03:20.399 --> 00:03:23.703
Jen Psaki showed a chart of how
much debt was accumulated

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:27.306
under former President Trump,
and said, "Republicans spent

00:03:27.306 --> 00:03:30.043
like drunken sailors
over the last four years."

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:34.313
And in some cases they also
looked like them.

00:03:34.313 --> 00:03:36.982
Former White House Press
Secretary Stephanie Grisham's

00:03:36.982 --> 00:03:39.185
book was released today,
find it in

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:42.254
the "complicit but needs money"
section.

00:03:42.254 --> 00:03:44.656
the New York Times published an
op-ed yesterday titled,

00:03:44.656 --> 00:03:46.626
"What's Wrong With Kyrsten
Sinema?"

00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:51.230
Well, for one thing, I think she
may be color blind.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:54.166
Former presidential candidate
Andrew Yang announced yesterday

00:03:54.166 --> 00:03:57.069
that he has changed his voting
registration from Democrat

00:03:57.069 --> 00:03:59.572
to Independent,
raising the question,

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:03.309
if a tree falls in the woods
can we listen to that

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:05.878
instead of Andrew Yang?

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:07.947
And finally,
the rights to the Folgers

00:04:07.947 --> 00:04:11.283
"the best part of waking up"
jingle recently sold at auction

00:04:11.283 --> 00:04:15.154
for more than $90,000 while the
"Kars 4 Kids" jingle

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:17.757
was taken out back
and shot in the head.

00:04:19.958 --> 00:04:22.962
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer spoke yesterday

00:04:22.962 --> 00:04:25.998
on the Senate floor and said
that the U.S. is getting

00:04:25.998 --> 00:04:28.767
"dangerously close" to hitting
the debt ceiling,

00:04:28.767 --> 00:04:32.138
which is scary because there has
never been a group of people

00:04:32.138 --> 00:04:36.642
less likely to spontaneously
raise the roof.

00:04:36.642 --> 00:04:38.745
President Biden had lunch today
with Vice President

00:04:38.745 --> 00:04:43.582
Kamala Harris, and even that
bill couldn't get figured out.

00:04:43.582 --> 00:04:46.419
In a new interview, ex-UN
Ambassador Nikki Haley

00:04:46.419 --> 00:04:49.355
said that she calls former
President Trump a friend,

00:04:49.355 --> 00:04:52.859
while Trump calls her "Linda."

00:04:52.859 --> 00:04:55.828
The U.S. Capitol Police,
yesterday, forcibly removed

00:04:55.828 --> 00:04:58.464
a man from a suspicious SUV
parked outside of

00:04:58.464 --> 00:05:00.399
the Supreme Court,
they knew something was off

00:05:00.399 --> 00:05:04.370
when the back window didn't have
this sticker on it.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:07.540
That's right the Capitol Police
removed a man from a suspicious

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.342
SUV parked outside of the
Supreme Court,

00:05:09.342 --> 00:05:13.078
the man was apparently so
suspicious Republicans want him

00:05:13.078 --> 00:05:15.214
on the Supreme Court.

00:05:15.214 --> 00:05:18.051
Facebook released a statement
yesterday explaining the cause

00:05:18.051 --> 00:05:20.753
of Monday's 6-hour-long outage,
and man,

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:23.322
she is screwing everything up,
lately.

00:05:23.322 --> 00:05:25.791
I unplugged the server so I
could charge my phone.

00:05:25.791 --> 00:05:28.594
Not sorry.

00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:31.230
Singer Adele, yesterday,
announced she'll release

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:33.899
a new single called "Easy On Me"
later this month.

00:05:33.899 --> 00:05:36.402
Incidentally,
a new single is also

00:05:36.402 --> 00:05:38.638
who's gonna listen to it
the most.

00:05:38.638 --> 00:05:41.640
[ Laughter ]

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:43.209
Poor lady, take a stock photo.

00:05:43.209 --> 00:05:44.777
She's like,
"This'll never come up."

00:05:44.777 --> 00:05:48.280
[ Laughter ]

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.783
"They won't use this one."

00:05:50.783 --> 00:05:53.752
More apartments in Manhattan
sold in the third quarter

00:05:53.752 --> 00:05:56.788
of this year than any other time
in the last 32 years.

00:05:56.788 --> 00:05:59.959
So now the only affordable
neighborhood in New York

00:05:59.959 --> 00:06:02.395
is Wehu, meaning
"west of the Hudson"

00:06:02.395 --> 00:06:04.397
and, yeah it's -- sorry --
it's New Jersey.

00:06:04.397 --> 00:06:08.734
[ Laughter ]

00:06:08.734 --> 00:06:11.437
You have a view of Manhattan.

00:06:11.437 --> 00:06:14.373
The fast food-chain Wendy's
announced a partnership with

00:06:14.373 --> 00:06:16.142
Kellogg's yesterday
to release

00:06:16.142 --> 00:06:18.177
a chocolate frosty-flavored
cereal.

00:06:18.177 --> 00:06:21.614
Not to be outdone, McDonald's is
releasing a McFlurry cereal

00:06:21.614 --> 00:06:24.717
that is temporarily
out of service.

00:06:24.717 --> 00:06:27.286
And, finally, according to the
latest rankings,

00:06:27.286 --> 00:06:30.522
former President Trump is no
longer on Forbes magazine's list

00:06:30.522 --> 00:06:33.926
of the 400 richest Americans,
but on the right side,

00:06:33.926 --> 00:06:37.230
he still made the list of the 46
greatest Presidents.

00:06:38.831 --> 00:06:41.667
According to the latest poll
numbers, President Biden's

00:06:41.667 --> 00:06:45.237
approval rating is 38% which is
the lowest it's been

00:06:45.237 --> 00:06:46.738
since taking office.

00:06:46.738 --> 00:06:51.377
Well, come on, America, what do
you want him to do? Something?

00:06:51.377 --> 00:06:54.546
According to a new Senate report
former President Trump directly

00:06:54.546 --> 00:06:58.117
asked the Justice Department on
nine separate occasions

00:06:58.117 --> 00:07:00.619
to overturn the 2020 election.

00:07:00.619 --> 00:07:03.756
Nine? Was he in the back seat of
the car?

00:07:03.756 --> 00:07:05.224
"Will you overturn the
election?" "No!"

00:07:05.224 --> 00:07:06.659
"Will you overturn the elect--?"
"No!"

00:07:06.659 --> 00:07:08.527
"Will you overturn the e--?"

00:07:08.527 --> 00:07:10.129
In her new book,
former White House

00:07:10.129 --> 00:07:11.931
Press Secretary
Stephanie Grisham writes

00:07:11.931 --> 00:07:15.501
that Ivanka Trump used to ask
her to suppress unflattering

00:07:15.501 --> 00:07:16.969
news stories about her.

00:07:16.969 --> 00:07:18.404
Here's what
that would look like --

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:26.311
According to a new report,
former President Trump

00:07:26.311 --> 00:07:31.150
did not want to use anesthesia
for his secret 2019 colonoscopy

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.951
because he did not want
Mike Pence to

00:07:32.951 --> 00:07:34.453
temporarily assume power.

00:07:34.453 --> 00:07:38.257
But joke's on him because
Mike Pence is anesthesia.

00:07:38.257 --> 00:07:42.027
"Mr. President I just want to
sincerely thank you

00:07:42.027 --> 00:07:45.097
for your leadership --
okay he's out."

00:07:45.097 --> 00:07:48.267
Today was Russian President
Vladimir Putin's 69th birthday

00:07:48.267 --> 00:07:51.337
and I think I know what he
wished for.

00:07:51.337 --> 00:07:53.673
Universal Studios in Orlando has
announced that

00:07:53.673 --> 00:07:57.076
the Shrek 4-D simulator show
will close next year

00:07:57.076 --> 00:08:01.280
because it turns out, nobody
actually wanted to smell Shrek.

00:08:02.148 --> 00:08:05.251
Netflix announced yesterday that
it will release 11 new

00:08:05.251 --> 00:08:08.654
holiday movies before Christmas
and I think they're running low

00:08:08.654 --> 00:08:10.756
on ideas.

00:08:10.756 --> 00:08:13.492
And finally, in a new interview,
singer Meghan Trainor

00:08:13.492 --> 00:08:15.927
said she and her husband have
two toilets next to each other

00:08:15.927 --> 00:08:18.764
in their bathroom so they can
spend more time together.

00:08:18.764 --> 00:08:20.533
In case you're wondering why
there was no

00:08:20.533 --> 00:08:23.569
"stars, they're just like us"
section this week.

00:08:23.569 --> 00:08:26.038
And that, you guys,
was a monologue.

